### 0. 준비: 로그인 - accessToken을 tokenA에 자동 저장 (week7.http에서 a@umc.com 가입 필요)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@umc.com",
  "password": "Umc1234!"
}

> {% client.global.set("tokenA", response.body.result.accessToken); %}

### 1. 즐겨찾기 등록 (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 550
}

### 2. 같은 요청 한 번 더 (409 FAVORITE409_1)
POST http://localhost:8080/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 550
}

### 3. 내 즐겨찾기 목록 (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 4. 즐겨찾기 여부 - 등록한 영화 (200, isFavorite: true)
GET http://localhost:8080/favorites/550
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 5. 즐겨찾기 해제 (200, result: null)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/favorites/550
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 6. 해제 후 여부 (200, isFavorite: false)
GET http://localhost:8080/favorites/550
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 7. 빈 목록 (200, [])
GET http://localhost:8080/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 8. 영화 기록 저장 - 평점 + 즐겨찾기 (201, rating과 favorite 모두)
POST http://localhost:8080/movie-records
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 238,
  "score": 5,
  "comment": "다시 보고 싶은 영화입니다.",
  "addToFavorites": true
}

### 9. 같은 요청 다시 (409 RATING409_1, 새 행이 생기지 않아야 함)
POST http://localhost:8080/movie-records
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 238,
  "score": 5,
  "comment": "다시 보고 싶은 영화입니다.",
  "addToFavorites": true
}

### 10. 트랜잭션 롤백 확인: 즐겨찾기만 이미 있는 영화에 기록 저장 (409 FAVORITE409_1, rating도 저장되지 않아야 함)
POST http://localhost:8080/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 680
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/movie-records
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 680,
  "score": 4,
  "comment": "롤백 확인",
  "addToFavorites": true
}

### 11. 평점만 확인 - 680에는 평점이 없어야 한다 (rating 롤백 확인)
GET http://localhost:8080/members/1/ratings

### 실패 케이스
### 12. 토큰 없이 즐겨찾기 등록 (401 AUTH401_2)
POST http://localhost:8080/favorites
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 550
}

### 13. movieId에 0 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 0
}

### 14. 존재하지 않는 즐겨찾기 해제 (404 FAVORITE404_1)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/favorites/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
